          "content": {
            "size": 14938,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<style>\n.donation_pay .pay_details .SBI_hide,.donation_pay .pay_details .AB_hide{\n\tdisplay:none !important;\n}\n.svbc .pay_details .SBI_hide,.svbc .pay_details .AB_hide, .svbc .pay_details .ICICI_hide{\n\tdisplay:none !important;\n}\n.UNION_hide{\n\tdisplay: block !important;\n}\n.ICICI_hide{\n\tdisplay: block !important;\n}\n.pay{\n\tfont-size:15px !important;\t\n\tmargin-left:15px;\n\tmargin-top:16px;\n\tfont-weight:bold;\n}\n.pay-1{\n\tfont-size:12px !important;\n\tmargin-left:15px;\n\tmargin-top:10px;\n\tmargin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.cont-1{\n\theight:auto;\n\tbackground-color: #fefbd5;\n\tborder: 1px solid #ffb400;\n\tmargin-top:15px;\n\tline-height: 23px;\n\t    margin-bottom: 43px;\n}\n.radio-lrs{\n\t\n\tmargin-left:15px  !important;\n\topacity:1 !important;\n\twidth: 20px !important;\n    height: 30px;\n\tmargin-top: -3px  !important;\n}\n.span-6{ \n\t  padding-left: 37px;\n    padding-top: 16px;\n}\n\n.addon {\n    padding-top: 119px;\n    font-size: 12px !important;\n    margin-left: 37px !important;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n/* Base styling for Yes button */\n#edonation_paynow, #yclose, #emc {\n    background-color: #a30004; /* deep red */\n    color: white;\n    border: 2px solid #7f0003;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(163, 0, 4, 0.6);\n    outline: none;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n/* Hover effect */\n#edonation_paynow:hover, #yclose:hover, #emc:hover {\n    background-color: #7f0003;\n    border-color: #5c0002;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(163, 0, 4, 0.8);\n}\n\n/* Focus effect */\n#edonation_paynow:focus, #yclose:focus, #emc:focus {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(163, 0, 4, 1);\n    animation: glow 1s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n}\n\n/* Optional glowing animation */\n@keyframes glow {\n    from { box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(163, 0, 4, 0.5); }\n    to   { box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(163, 0, 4, 1); }\n}\n\n.payment-table {\n    width: 60%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n\n/* Mobile view */\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .payment-table {\n        width: 100% !important;\n    }\n\t\n\t.welcome-inner {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n\t\tmargin-right: 5% !important;\n    }\n\t\n\t.pay_mdetails {\n        font-size: 75% !important;\n        padding: 5px !important;\n\t}\n}\n\n/* Tablet view */\n@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px) {\n\t.modal-dialog {\n        width: 98% !important;\n        height: auto;\n    }\n}\n\n/* tablet view */\n@media (max-width: 960px) and (min-width: 768px) {\n\t.col-sm-3 {\n        width: auto !important;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"loader\" id='loader' style=\"display:none;\">\n\t<div class=\"shade\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"popup\">\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<!--Terms and Conditions popup-->\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"myModal\" role=\"dialog\" style=\"display:none;\">\n\t<div class=\"modal-dialog\">\n\t\t<!-- Modal content-->\n\t\t<div class=\"modal-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-header\">\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" ng-click=\"bdc.ClosePopUp()\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <img src=\"content/img/icon-close.png\"> -->\n\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"modal-title\">Terms and Conditions</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-body\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t1. Tirumala Tirupati Devasthanams is a charitable trust which supervises the administrative functions necessary to conduct the various traditional rituals at Sri Venkateswara Temple, Tirumala.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t2. TTD does not solicit or canvass for any offering. TTD has its own fund, the corpus of which, shall include all the amounts received by it by way of offering, gifts, kanukas including offerings deposited in Hundi and any income from any other source as per sec 111 of A.P.Charitable and Hindu Religious Institutions and Endowments Act 1987.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t3. It is hereby made clear that all offerings made through the online facility are accepted by TTD as a non-reclaimable transfer to the Lord's Hundi and the donor is not entitled to any claim that may be available to a consumer under this payment mode. You have read and agreed to disclaim any claim that may accrue to you as a customer in an online transaction, in view of the special nature of these services.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t4. All Legal Options (ALO) shall alone have exclusive jurisdiction of Tirupati only or High Court of Andhra Pradesh.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"modal-backdrop fade in\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid hundi_hd clearfix\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-8\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"#welcome\" class=\"welcome-inner\"><def class=\"welcome\"></def></a>\n\t\t\tSrivani Trust Donations\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-4 historyLink\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"#/SrivaniBookingsHistory\" >View Transaction History</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<!--Error message popup-->\n<div class=\"modal ng-scope mstr_popup\" id=\"myModalerr\" role=\"dialog\" style=\"display:none\">\n\t<div class=\"modal-dialog\">\n\t\t<!-- Modal content-->\n\t\t<div class=\"modal-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-header\" style=\"text-align:center; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 5px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span><img style=\"padding-bottom: 10px; width: 25px;\" src=\"content/img/AlertIcon.png\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"modal-title\" style=\"font-size: 25px;\">Alert</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-body donation_paynum\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"text-left\" style=\"font-size: 18px; text-align: center;\"> {{ecspc.Errmsg}} </p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearfix\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text-center\" style=\"display:block\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"btn btn-act text-center\" id=\"yclose\" style=\"min-width: 50px;\" ng-click=\"ecspc.yclose()\">OK</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"modal-backdrop fade in\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<!--Error message popup start-->\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"ErrorMsgPopUp\" role=\"dialog\" style=\"display:none\">\n\t<div class=\"modal-dialog\" style=\"width: fit-content;\">\n\t\t<!-- Modal content-->\n\t\t<div class=\"modal-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-header\" style=\"text-align:center; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 5px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span><img style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; width: 30px;\" src=\"content/img/AlertIcon.png\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"modal-title\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 25px;\">Alert</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-body\">\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; text-align: center;\">{{ecspc.ErrorMsg}}</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 text-center ptop10\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"btn btn-act\" id=\"emc\" style=\"min-width: 80px;\" ng-click=\"ecspc.ErrorMsgclose()\">OK</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"modal-backdrop fade in\"></div>\n</div>\n<!--Error message popup end-->\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"mn_cnt\">\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 cnt_new\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\" dynamic-height>\n\t<div class=\"container-fluid trust_cnt\">\n\t\t<!-- <div class=\"back_cnt col-sm-12 mpr\" ng-hide=\"ecspc.flag\" >\n\t\t\t&#10094;&#10094; <a href=\"#/edonationConfirm\" class=\"bk-lnk\"  >Back</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"back_cnt col-sm-12 mpr\" ng-show=\"ecspc.flag\" >\n\t\t\t&#10094;&#10094; <a href=\"#/edonationSrivani\" class=\"bk-lnk\"  >Back</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t -->\n\t\t<!-- <div class=\"col-sm-12 usrinfo_cnt clearfix user_img cnt_hide\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"cnt_arwlft\"></span>\n\t\t\t<figure ng-hide=\"ecspc.primaryImfFlag\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.userImageLocation}}\" alt=\"user\" width=70 height=70/>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"col-sm-9\" id=\"prim_data\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong ng-bind=\"ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimFirstName\"></strong>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row clearfix personal-details\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"col-md-2 col-sm-4col-xs-12 pull-left phone clearfix\" ng-bind=\"ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimPhoneMobile\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-xs-12 pull-left email clearfix\" ng-bind=\"ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimEmail\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-xs-12 pull-left pan clearfix\" ng-show=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.checkdonorPanNo}}\">{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.donorPanNo | uppercase}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"col-md-5 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 pull-left address clearfix\" ng-hide=\"ecspc.flag\">{{ecspc.pageDetails.add}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 usrinfo_cnt clearfix mtp10 \" ng-show='ecspc.pageDetails.userData.donorJointUserFlag'>\n\t\t\t<figure ng-hide=\"ecspc.jointImfFlag\">\n\t\t\t\t<img ng-src={{ecspc.pageDetails.jointUserImg}} alt=\"joint donor\" height=\"70\" width=\"70\">\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"col-sm-9 col-xs-8 joint_boxinfo donor_jointpay\" id=\"joint_data\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 row joint\">\n\t\t\t\t\tJoint Donor\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"name bdr0 joint_info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.donorName}}</strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"phone\">{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.donorMobileNo}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='pan' ng-show=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.checkJointDonorPANId}}\">{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.jointDonorPanId | uppercase}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t</div> -->\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 usrinfo_cnt clearfix pay_details\" style=\"padding:15px; padding-top: 0px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 pdlft0 sed_gridtitle\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5>Donation and Darshan Payment Summary</h5>\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<table cellpadding=\"10\" class=\"payment-table\" border=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td width=\"60%\">Srivani Trust Donation</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"txtBold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Rs. {{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.offeringAmount}}/-</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td>TTD Break Darshan</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"txtBold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Rs. {{ecspc.pageDetails.darshanAmount}}/-</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td>Total</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"txtBold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Rs. {{ecspc.pageDetails.totalamount}}/-</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 usrinfo_cnt clearfix pay_mdetails\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; margin-top: 15px;\" ng-if=\"ecspc.pageDetails.memberDetails[0]\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 pdlft0 sed_gridtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5>Pilgrim Details</h5>\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<table class =\"\" id=\"tbh\" cellpadding = \"5\" width=\"100%\" >\n\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>S.No.</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Name</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Age</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Gender</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>ID Proof Type</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>ID Proof Number</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr ng-repeat=\"nominees in ecspc.pageDetails.memberDetails track by $index\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"S.No.\">{{$index+1}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"Name\">{{nominees.firstName}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"Age\">{{nominees.age}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"Gender\">{{nominees.gender}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"ID Proof Type\">{{ecspc.getIDCardName(nominees.idProofType)}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"ID Proof Number\" ng-if=\"nominees.userAadharNumber\">{{nominees.userAadharNumber}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td data-label=\"ID Proof Number\" ng-if=\"nominees.userPassportNumber\" style=\"text-transform: uppercase;\">{{nominees.userPassportNumber}}</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t<!-- <payment class=\"donation_pay hide_charges_donation\" selected-Bank-Name=\"selectedBank(selectBank)\"></payment>\n\t\t\t<div class='err cal_err err_epay'>\n\t\t\t\t<p>{{ecspc.errormessage}}</p>\n\t\t\t</div> -->\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cont-1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 60px; padding-left: 15px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 pdlft0 sed_gridtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5>Payment Gateway(s)</h5>\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- <div class=\"pay-1\">NOTE: All Debit/Credit Cards are accepted.</div> -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12\" style=\"margin-left: 10px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input style=\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\topacity: 1 !important;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twidth: 20px !important;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\theight: 30px;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 20px !important;\" type=\"radio\" ng-change=\"selectedBank(ecspc.bankValue)\" name=\"unionBank\" value=\"{{ecspc.unionValue}}\" ng-model=\"ecspc.bankValue\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\" font-weight:bold;   margin-left: 25px;\"><img style=\"height: 70px\" src=\"content/img/Union_img.png\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <span class=\"help-block mtop0\" style=\"margin-top: 6px; margin-left: 46px;font-size: 11px;\">(Average Success Rate : {{ecspc.icicisuccessRate}})</span> -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<br/>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12\" style=\"margin-left: 10px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input style=\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\topacity: 1 !important;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twidth: 20px !important;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\theight: 30px;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 20px !important;\" type=\"radio\" ng-change=\"selectedBank(ecspc.bankValue)\" name=\"iciciBank\" value=\"{{ecspc.iciciValue}}\" ng-model=\"ecspc.bankValue\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\" font-weight:bold;   margin-left: 25px;\"><img style=\"height: 70px\" src=\"content/img/ICICI_img.png\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<br/>\n\t\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-left: 0px;\">Additional payment gateway charges are applicable.</div>\n\t\t\t<div class='err cal_err err_epay'>\n\t\t\t\t<p>{{ecspc.errormessage}}</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"donate_box\" style=\"padding-top: 20px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pay_note pay_note_epay\">\n\n\t\t\t\tClicking <strong>Pay Now</strong> confirms your acceptance of the <a class=\"terms\" ng-click=\"bdc.TermsPopup()\">Terms and Conditions </a>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-6 text-right btn_cnt_new btn_mov_new wdh50\" style=\"bottom: 10px; !important\">\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"btn btn-act\" ng-disabled=\"ecspc.hidebutton\" ng-click=\"ecspc.back()\">\n\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"btn btn-act click1 term\" id=\"edonation_paynow\" ng-disabled=\"ecspc.hidebutton\" ng-click=\"ecspc.prePayment()\" >\n\t\t\t\t\tPay Now\n\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<form ng-show='false' method=\"post\" action=\"\" id=\"anonForm\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"mobileNumber\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimPhoneMobile}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"firstName\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimFirstName}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"lastName\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimLastName}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"orderId\"  value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.offeringid}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"userId\"   value=\"a\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"email\"   value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.piligrimEmail}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"amount\"  value=\"{{ecspc.bankName!=7?ecspc.pageDetails.totalamount:''}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"behalf\"  value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.onBehalfOf}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"pgId\" value=\"{{ecspc.bankName}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"behalf\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.onBehalfOf}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"currency\"  value=\"INR\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"modName\" value=\"EDON\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"trustId\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.trustId}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"trustName\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.trustName}}\"/>\n\t\t\t<!--input type=\"hidden\" name=\"schemeName\" value=\"{{ecspc.pageDetails.userData.schemeName}}\"/-->\n\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" id=\"hiddenFormClick\"value=\"submit\">\n\t\t</form>\n\n\t</div>\n\t<div ng-bind-html=\"ecspc.pnbHTML()\" id=\"pnbForm\" ng-show='false'></div>\n\t\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n\t$(document).ready(function() {\n\t\t$(\".nav a\").attr(\"tabindex\", \"-1\");\n\t\t$(\".log_info a\").attr(\"tabindex\", \"-1\");\n\t}); \n</script>"
