athi)\": \"Pushpayagam (Sri GT, Tirupathi)\",\r\n\t\t\"Vahana Seva(Morning Brahmotsavams, Sri GT, Tirupathi)\": \"Vahana Seva(Morning Brahmotsavams, Sri GT, Tirupathi)\",\r\n\t\t\"Vahana Seva(Evening Brahmotsavams, Sri GT, Tirupathi)\": \"Vahana Seva(Evening Brahmotsavams, Sri GT, Tirupathi)\",\r\n\t\t\"Vastralankarana Seva (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\": \"Vastralankarana Seva (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\",\r\n\t\t\"Abhishekam to Moolavarlu (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\": \"Abhishekam to Moolavarlu (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\",\r\n\t\t\"Kalyanotsavam (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\": \"Kalyanotsavam (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\",\r\n\t\t\"Astadala Pada Padmaradhana (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\": \"Astadala Pada Padmaradhana (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\",\r\n\t\t\"Asthothara sata kalasabhishekam (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\": \"Asthothara sata kalasabhishekam (Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\",\r\n\t\t\"Arjitha Kalyanotsavam (Brahmotsavams, Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\": \"Arjitha Kalyanotsavam (Brahmotsavams, Sri P.V.S.T,Appalayagunta)\",\r\n\t\t\"Abhishekam to Moolavarlu (Sri S.N.S.T, Tiruchanoor)\": \"Abhishekam to Moolavarlu (Sri S.N.S.T, Tiruchanoor)\",\r\n\t\t\"Abhishekam to Moolavarlu (Srinivasa Temple,Tiruchanoor)\": \"Abhishekam to Moolavarlu (Srinivasa Temple,Tiruchanoor)\",\r\n\t\t\"Kalyana kankanam (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\": \"Kalyana kankanam (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\",\r\n\t\t\"kalyanotsavam (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\": \"kalyanotsavam (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\",\r\n\t\t\"Veda Asirvachanam (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\": \"Veda Asirvachanam (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\",\r\n\t\t\"Swarna Pushpaarchana (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\": \"Swarna Pushpaarchana (Sri KalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,Srinivasamangapuram )\",\r\n\t\t\"Astothara Satha