 of the temple\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is In front of the temple\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is near to the office inside the temple\": \" 1.The reporting point for availing Seva is near to the office inside the temple\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is In front of Ammavari Koneru, SuryaNarayanaswamy Temple\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is In front of Ammavari Koneru, SuryaNarayanaswamy Temple\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Back side of Z.P High school, Srinivasa temple\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Back side of Z.P High school, Srinivasa temple\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Inside the SriKalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,SrinivasaMangapuram\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Inside the SriKalyanaVenkateswaraSwamy Temple,SrinivasaMangapuram.\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Kodanda Rama Swamy Temple, Vontimitta\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Kodanda Rama Swamy Temple, Vontimitta\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Kalyana Venkateswara Temple, Narayanavanam\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Kalyana Venkateswara Temple, Narayanavanam\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Kodanda Rama Swamy Temple, Tirupati\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Kodanda Rama Swamy Temple, Tirupati\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Vedanarayana Swamy Temple, Nagalapuram\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri Vedanarayana Swamy Temple, Nagalapuram\",\r\n\t\t\"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri kapileswara Swamy Vari Temple, Tirupati\": \"1.The reporting point for availing Seva is Sri kapileswara Swamy Vari Temple, Tirupati\",\r\n\t\t\"PAT-Seva\": \"PAT-சேவை\",\r\n\t\t\"SGT-Seva\": \"SGT-சேவை\",\r\n\t\t\"Sri PVST-Seva\": \"Sri PVST-Seva\",\r\n\t\t\"Sri SNT-Seva\": 